  "item_short_desc": "<p>Designed with comfort and warmth in mind, our Trailsman Sherpa Fleece Jacket is a must-have for all your outdoor activities. Whether you&rsquo;re embarking on a challenging hiking expedition, exploring new trails, or simply enjoying a casual stroll in nature, this fleece jacket will be alongside you every step of the way.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133334",
  "description": "<p>Designed with comfort and warmth in mind, our Trailsman Sherpa Fleece Jacket is a must-have for all your outdoor activities. Whether you&rsquo;re embarking on a challenging hiking expedition, exploring new trails, or simply enjoying a casual stroll in nature, this fleece jacket will be alongside you every step of the way. Superior Insulation and Comfort: Crafted from a soft and premium polyester sherpa fleece, this midweight jacket provides the perfect balance of warmth and breathability, without the worry of overheating. It can be worn as a standalone jacket (perfect for fall and spring), or as a liner for a soft shell jacket, parka, or winter coat. Dependable &amp; Long-Lasting: In addition to providing comfort and warmth, the Trailsman Sherpa Fleece Jacket is also rugged and is built for the outdoorsman. The reinforced shoulder yoke enhances the jacket&rsquo;s durability and performance, allowing you to complete any task at hand. Protection from the Elements: Equipped with a full zip main closure featuring an interior storm placket, this fleece jacket offers exceptional defense against the wind and cold. The elastic binding cuffs and drawstring bottom keeps the wind out, ensuring you stay snug and warm. This helps seal in the warmth, preventing unnecessary heat loss. Storage Pockets: Need extra storage when you&rsquo;re on the go? No problem! The left chest zipper pocket offers a secure spot for storing essentials like keys or a wallet. The zipper slash pockets provide ample space for keeping your hands warm or for holding small everyday carry items.</p>",
